OL,3,GNEWSAWater park and hotel resort plan
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a major indoor water park
OL,7,Fresort, hotel and conference centre in
OL,8,FDerbyshire have been approved despite
OL,9,Flarge-scale opposition.
OL,11,FBolsover District Council's planning
OL,12,Fcommittee approved the Great Wolf
OL,13,FResorts development at Whitwell Common
OL,14,Fon Wednesday and said it could generate
OL,15,F#18.8m for the district's economy.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
